        "ui.personalResearchStart.messageGoalsApplyToActualSampledLocationsNot": "Goals apply to actual sampled locations, not the surrounding area. Gaps and larger recorded steps break the sampled path; this is an analysis setting, not an aircraft limit. Free flight works from anywhere.",
