        "ui.personalResearchStart.messageEachSelectedObjectiveRequiresQualifiedSamplesAnd": "Each selected objective requires {value1} qualified samples and {value2} sampled locations.",
        "ui.personalResearchStart.messageUsesOriginalAmbientTemperatureReadingsAndAFictional": "Uses original ambient-temperature readings and a fictional modeled response. No physical sensor is validated.",
        "ui.personalResearchStart.messagePilotDocumentationIsSeparateFromOptionalScientific": "Pilot documentation is separate from optional scientific collection.",
        "ui.personalResearchStart.messageAirTemperatureWorksWithoutExternalSourcesTerrain": "Air Temperature works without external sources. Terrain and historical surface-temperature objectives need compatible retained external data.",
        "ui.personalResearchStart.messageCollectActualRetainedAtmosphericReadingsNoExternal": "Collect actual retained atmospheric readings. No external dataset, account or internet connection is required.",
        "ui.personalResearchStart.messageUsesOriginalFlightTelemetryFlightRecordingScientific": "Uses original flight telemetry. Flight recording, scientific collection and test-card activation remain independent.",
        "ui.personalResearchStart.messageYourResearchFlight": "Your Research Flight",
        "ui.personalResearchStart.message1UseStartRecordingThenStartScience": "1. Use Start Recording, then Start Science Collection. 2. Activate Card → Begin Attempt → End Attempt while collecting changing air temperatures. 3. End mission, then My Research → Review Sensor Checkout. Card controls never start or stop recording or science.",
        "ui.personalResearchStart.message1UseStartRecording2InPilot": "1. Use Start Recording. 2. In Pilot Observations, choose a Category and enter Notes, then Add observation marker or Save in-flight note. 3. End mission, then My Research → Review Scientific Observations. Optional instruments require Start Science Collection; no science starts automatically.",
        "ui.personalResearchStart.message1ReviewTheSelectedMeasurementsAndExisting": "1. Review the selected measurements and existing science/data readiness. 2. Use Start Recording, then Start Science Collection. 3. End mission and choose Review Terrain & Temperature Survey in My Research. Air temperature needs no external scene; missing required terrain/thermal data stays incomplete.",
        "ui.personalResearchStart.message1ReviewYourSamplingGoals2Use": "1. Review your sampling goals. 2. Use Start Recording, then explicitly Start Science Collection when armed. 3. Fly across different locations, then End mission and choose Review Atmospheric Transect in My Research. Optional Activate Card → Begin Attempt → End Attempt marks a shorter investigation; it does not start science.",
        "ui.personalResearchStart.message1ReviewTheSamplingBandsForYour": "1. Review the sampling bands for your aircraft. 2. Use Start Recording when ready and ensure science is Collecting; if armed, use Start Science Collection. 3. Climb or descend through achievable bands, then End mission and choose Review Atmospheric Profile in My Research. Optional Activate Card → Begin Attempt → End Attempt marks a shorter investigation; it does not start science.",
        "ui.personalResearchStart.message1ReviewTheTargetsForYourAircraft": "1. Review the targets for your aircraft. 2. Use Start Recording when ready; normal startup and readiness checks still apply. 3. In Personal Research Test Cards, choose Activate Card → Begin Attempt → End Attempt. End mission remains separate.",
        "ui.personalResearchStart.messageOriginalSimulatorAirTemperatureIsTheRequired": "Original simulator air temperature is the required input. The fictional first-order response is calculated only from saved valid readings. No physical or MSFS-mounted experimental sensor exists; constant temperatures may not exercise your chosen variation criterion.",
        "ui.personalResearchStart.messageTheseArePilotObservationsNotSensorMeasurements": "These are Pilot Observations, not sensor measurements or proof of a hypothesis. Host UTC is recorded at entry; unavailable or stale aircraft positions are left missing. Optional supporting values must exist in the science archive.",
        "ui.personalResearchStart.messageDEMDSMElevationsAreNotLiDARReturnsLandsat": "DEM/DSM elevations are not LiDAR returns. Landsat surface temperatures are historical satellite observations in Kelvin; simulator air temperature is a separate Celsius measurement. Each objective retains its own source, date, units and QA.",
        "ui.personalResearchStart.messageUsesActualSimulatorReportedAirTemperaturePressureWind": "Uses actual simulator-reported air temperature, pressure, wind and density at the aircraft. Missing or paused collection stays missing. These are not historical satellite surface temperatures, modeled weather away from the aircraft or real-world certified measurements.",
        "ui.personalResearchStart.messageARouteAndExtraInstrumentsAreOptional": "A route and extra instruments are optional for Flight-Regime Validation. Any added scientific instruments retain their own source requirements. Flight recording, scientific collection and test-card activation are independent.",
