        "ui.scientificAccess.messageOnePreparationSlotIsTheConservativeDefault": "One preparation slot is the conservative default; up to eight are configurable. Multi-provider benchmarks encountered rate limits and HTTP 503 at higher settings. Higher limits can saturate the network or trigger provider throttling. Each provider connection remains bounded; existing saved limits are preserved.",
