        "ui.organizationHosting.messageHobbyHasA5MonthMinimumCreditedToward": "Hobby has a $5/month minimum credited toward usage. Memory $10/GB-month; CPU $20/vCPU-month; volumes $0.15/GB-month; service egress $0.05/GB. Private Buckets $0.015/GB-month plus service transfer. Example assumptions: 0.75–1 GB combined app/database memory, 0.05–0.1 average vCPU, 5 GB volumes, 5 GB backup objects and 1 GB service egress total about $9–13/month. Independent recovery storage adds its own charges. This is an estimate, not a measured bill or spending cap; heavier use and Pro ($20 minimum) can exceed $20.",
        "ui.organizationHosting.messageMultiServiceTemplatesApplicationHostingPostgreSQLServiceVolumes": "Multi-service templates, application hosting, PostgreSQL service volumes and HTTPS.",
        "ui.organizationHosting.messagePrimaryCandidateTheFiveStageJourneyIsNot": "Primary candidate. The five-stage journey is not yet verified. Official Railway project configuration passes offline SDK validation. Restricted runtime, authenticated database trust and independently keyed recovery copies are implemented candidates; a published official template with a required per-owner public pairing, real ingress verification, independently controlled storage and fresh-account novice cloud acceptance remain required. No paid deployment is enabled.",
        "ui.organizationHosting.messageReviewRailwayCandidate": "Review Railway Candidate",
        "ui.organizationHosting.messageAbout1325MonthForASmallTestDeployment": "About $13.25/month for a small test deployment: $7 application + $6 paid 256 MB PostgreSQL + $0.25 for 1 GB protected configuration disk. PostgreSQL includes 1 GB; additional storage is $0.30/GB. A $25 Pro workspace or larger database raises the total above $20.",
        "ui.organizationHosting.messageApplicationManagedPostgreSQLHTTPSGeneratedSecretsAnd": "Application, managed PostgreSQL, HTTPS, generated secrets and Blueprint provisioning.",
        "ui.organizationHosting.messageReceivedEvidenceStaysInPaidPostgreSQLA": "Received evidence stays in paid PostgreSQL. A separate persistent disk retains the protected identity certificate.",
        "ui.organizationHosting.messageSecondaryCandidateTheUsualPrivateDatabaseURL": "Secondary candidate. The usual private database URL cannot satisfy VerifyFull TLS. A verified endpoint and restricted access, exact trusted proxy configuration, live provisioning, capacity measurements and recovery acceptance are still required. The smallest plans are not proven sufficient.",
        "ui.organizationHosting.messageReviewRenderCandidate": "Review Render Candidate",
        "ui.organizationHosting.messageAppPlatformFrom5MonthManagedPostgreSQL": "App Platform from $5/month + managed PostgreSQL compute from $15.15/month + separately priced database storage (10 GiB at $0.215/GiB/month adds about $2.15). About $22.30 before additional storage, bandwidth, backup/retention choices, tax or domains.",
        "ui.organizationHosting.messageAppPlatformContainersAndHTTPSSeparatelyProvisioned": "App Platform containers and HTTPS; separately provisioned Managed PostgreSQL.",
        "ui.organizationHosting.messagePaidManagedPostgreSQLIsRequiredTheStandard": "Paid Managed PostgreSQL is required. The standard Deploy button provisions only development databases, not this production database.",
        "ui.organizationHosting.messageNoVerifiedAeroScienceManagedDeploymentAdapterYet": "No verified AeroScience managed deployment adapter yet. Database provisioning, protected certificate storage and recovery are visible additional work; never use a development database for durable research.",
