        "help.quickStart.title": "Your first research flight",
        "help.quickStart.connect": "Open the companion and connect MSFS. Check the actual connection and freshness indicators before relying on aircraft telemetry.",
        "help.quickStart.prepare": "In Missions, choose an experiment and review its aircraft, instrument and source requirements. Fly Now prepares and selects a plan; it does not record a flight or collect science.",
        "help.quickStart.record": "Use Start Recording explicitly in Current Flight. Recording preserves the flight record; its active indicator alone does not mean scientific collection has started.",
        "help.quickStart.collect": "Review readiness, then explicitly start scientific collection or arm an automatic trigger. Armed means waiting, not collecting. Trust confirmed collection state and retained observations, not an optimistic button click.",
        "help.quickStart.pause": "Pausing science leaves flight recording running. Resume science when permitted, and end a scientific session or the flight using its separate explicit control.",
        "help.quickStart.results": "In Results, inspect Overview, Explore and Evidence. Original observations, modeled corridors, genuine DEM/DSM products and historical LiDAR returns remain different evidence. Missing coverage and unknown dates or height references remain unknown.",
        "help.quickStart.sources": "Use Scientific Library to review exact sources, download permissions, storage and dependencies. Downloading needs its existing authorization. Read the exact permanent-deletion preview before approving it; language selection never authorizes either action.",
        "help.quickStart.organizations": "An organization connection or assignment claim does not share your flight or upload evidence. Review the exact recipient and package, then authorize submission separately. Local evaluation is not server approval; live-location sharing requires separate consent.",
